    "Tap a YubiKey or another FIDO2 key on the iPhone, or plug it in, to open Ichor without Face ID. Up to two keys." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
